{
  "name": "BlogCanvas v0 - Content Factory Automation",
  "description": "Bare-bones Make.com automation: Topic → Draft → Review → WordPress Publish",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "Scenario 1: Topic → Draft Doc → Notify Editor",
      "description": "Watches Google Sheet for new topics, generates drafts with OpenAI, creates Google Docs, and notifies editor",
      "modules": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "watchRows",
          "label": "Watch for New Drafts",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "watchColumn": "status",
            "filter": {
              "status": "READY_TO_DRAFT"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "setVariables",
          "label": "Build Prompt Variables",
          "config": {
            "variables": [
              {
                "name": "topic",
                "value": "{{1.topic}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "primary_keyword",
                "value": "{{1.primary_keyword}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "intent",
                "value": "{{1.intent}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "target_word_count",
                "value": "{{1.target_word_count}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "client_name",
                "value": "{{1.client_name}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "site_url",
                "value": "{{1.site_url}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "batch_id",
                "value": "{{1.batch_id}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "textAggregator",
          "label": "Build OpenAI Prompt",
          "config": {
            "template": "You are an expert SEO content writer. Write a comprehensive blog post with the following requirements:\n\n**Topic:** {{2.topic}}\n**Primary Keyword:** {{2.primary_keyword}}\n**Search Intent:** {{2.intent}}\n**Target Word Count:** {{2.target_word_count}}\n**Client Website:** {{2.site_url}}\n\n**Requirements:**\n1. Write in HTML format ready for WordPress\n2. Include proper H1, H2, H3 headings\n3. Add a meta description (150-160 characters)\n4. Suggest a URL slug\n5. Include internal linking opportunities\n6. Write engaging, informative content that matches the search intent\n7. Ensure content is factually accurate and well-researched\n8. Include a compelling introduction and conclusion\n\n**Output Format (JSON):**\n{\n  \"title\": \"SEO-optimized title\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"150-160 char description\",\n  \"slug\": \"url-friendly-slug\",\n  \"content\": \"Full HTML content here\",\n  \"excerpt\": \"Short excerpt for WordPress\"\n}\n\nBegin writing:"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "http",
          "action": "makeRequest",
          "label": "Generate Draft with OpenAI",
          "config": {
            "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer {{$env.OPENAI_API_KEY}}",
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
              "model": "gpt-4",
              "messages": [
                {
                  "role": "system",
                  "content": "You are an expert SEO content writer specializing in WordPress-ready blog posts. Always return valid JSON."
                },
                {
                  "role": "user",
                  "content": "{{3.text}}"
                }
              ],
              "temperature": 0.7,
              "max_tokens": 4000
            }
          },
          "errorHandling": {
            "onError": "routeToError"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "parseJSON",
          "label": "Parse OpenAI Response",
          "config": {
            "data": "{{4.choices[0].message.content}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "googleDocs",
          "action": "createDocument",
          "label": "Create Draft Document",
          "config": {
            "title": "{{2.topic}} - {{2.primary_keyword}}",
            "body": "**Batch ID:** {{2.batch_id}}\n**Client:** {{2.client_name}}\n**Primary Keyword:** {{2.primary_keyword}}\n**Intent:** {{2.intent}}\n**Target Word Count:** {{2.target_word_count}}\n**Generated:** {{$now}}\n\n---\n\n**SEO Title:** {{5.title}}\n**Meta Description:** {{5.meta_description}}\n**Slug:** {{5.slug}}\n\n---\n\n{{5.content}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "type": "googleDrive",
          "action": "moveFile",
          "label": "Move to Client Folder",
          "config": {
            "fileId": "{{6.id}}",
            "folderId": "/Clients/{{2.client_name}}/Drafts"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "updateRow",
          "label": "Update Sheet with Draft URL",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{1.id}}",
            "values": {
              "draft_doc_url": "{{6.url}}",
              "status": "NEEDS_REVIEW",
              "last_updated": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "slack",
          "action": "sendMessage",
          "label": "Notify Editor (Slack)",
          "config": {
            "channel": "#content-review",
            "text": "📝 *New Draft Ready for Review*\n\n*Topic:* {{2.topic}}\n*Client:* {{2.client_name}}\n*Keyword:* {{2.primary_keyword}}\n*Word Count Target:* {{2.target_word_count}}\n\n*Draft Document:* {{6.url}}\n\n*Batch ID:* {{2.batch_id}}\n\nPlease review and update status in the Content_Batch sheet."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "updateRow",
          "label": "Error Handler - Update Status",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{1.id}}",
            "values": {
              "status": "ERROR",
              "editor_notes": "OpenAI API Error: {{4.error}}",
              "last_updated": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "type": "slack",
          "action": "sendMessage",
          "label": "Error Handler - Notify Admin",
          "config": {
            "channel": "#content-errors",
            "text": "❌ *Draft Generation Failed*\n\n*Batch ID:* {{2.batch_id}}\n*Topic:* {{2.topic}}\n*Error:* {{4.error}}\n\nPlease check the Content_Batch sheet and retry."
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "from": 1,
          "to": 2
        },
        {
          "from": 2,
          "to": 3
        },
        {
          "from": 3,
          "to": 4
        },
        {
          "from": 4,
          "to": 5,
          "condition": "success"
        },
        {
          "from": 4,
          "to": 10,
          "condition": "error"
        },
        {
          "from": 5,
          "to": 6
        },
        {
          "from": 6,
          "to": 7
        },
        {
          "from": 7,
          "to": 8
        },
        {
          "from": 8,
          "to": 9
        },
        {
          "from": 10,
          "to": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scenario 2: Approval → WordPress Publish",
      "description": "Watches for approved posts and publishes them to WordPress",
      "modules": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "watchRows",
          "label": "Watch for Approved Posts",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "watchColumn": "status",
            "filter": {
              "status": "APPROVED_FOR_PUBLISH"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "getRow",
          "label": "Get Full Row Data",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{1.id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "googleDocs",
          "action": "getDocument",
          "label": "Get Draft Content",
          "config": {
            "documentId": "{{2.draft_doc_url}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "textParser",
          "label": "Extract HTML from Doc",
          "config": {
            "text": "{{3.body}}",
            "pattern": "---\\n\\n(.*)",
            "extract": "content"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "setVariables",
          "label": "Prepare WordPress Data",
          "config": {
            "variables": [
              {
                "name": "wp_status",
                "value": "{{2.publish_mode}}"
              },
              {
                "name": "wp_date",
                "value": "{{2.publish_datetime}}"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "http",
          "action": "makeRequest",
          "label": "Publish to WordPress",
          "config": {
            "url": "{{2.site_url}}/wp-json/wp/v2/posts",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Basic {{$env.WORDPRESS_AUTH}}",
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
              "title": "{{2.topic}}",
              "content": "{{4.content}}",
              "status": "{{5.wp_status}}",
              "date": "{{5.wp_date}}",
              "slug": "{{2.primary_keyword}}",
              "excerpt": "{{2.topic}} - {{2.primary_keyword}}"
            }
          },
          "errorHandling": {
            "onError": "routeToError"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "updateRow",
          "label": "Update Sheet with Post Info",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{1.id}}",
            "values": {
              "wp_post_id": "{{6.id}}",
              "wp_post_url": "{{6.link}}",
              "status": "PUBLISHED",
              "last_updated": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "type": "slack",
          "action": "sendMessage",
          "label": "Notify Publication Success",
          "config": {
            "channel": "#content-published",
            "text": "✅ *Post Published Successfully*\n\n*Topic:* {{2.topic}}\n*Client:* {{2.client_name}}\n*WordPress Post:* {{6.link}}\n*Post ID:* {{6.id}}\n\n*Batch ID:* {{2.batch_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "updateRow",
          "label": "Error Handler - Update Status",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{1.id}}",
            "values": {
              "status": "ERROR",
              "editor_notes": "WordPress API Error: {{6.error}}",
              "last_updated": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "type": "slack",
          "action": "sendMessage",
          "label": "Error Handler - Notify Admin",
          "config": {
            "channel": "#content-errors",
            "text": "❌ *WordPress Publish Failed*\n\n*Batch ID:* {{2.batch_id}}\n*Topic:* {{2.topic}}\n*Error:* {{6.error}}\n\nPlease check the Content_Batch sheet and retry."
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "from": 1,
          "to": 2
        },
        {
          "from": 2,
          "to": 3
        },
        {
          "from": 3,
          "to": 4
        },
        {
          "from": 4,
          "to": 5
        },
        {
          "from": 5,
          "to": 6
        },
        {
          "from": 6,
          "to": 7,
          "condition": "success"
        },
        {
          "from": 6,
          "to": 9,
          "condition": "error"
        },
        {
          "from": 7,
          "to": 8
        },
        {
          "from": 9,
          "to": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scenario 2B: Client Approval via Google Form",
      "description": "Alternative trigger: Client approves via Google Form",
      "modules": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "googleForms",
          "action": "watchResponses",
          "label": "Watch Form Responses",
          "config": {
            "formId": "{{$env.APPROVAL_FORM_ID}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "filter",
          "label": "Filter Approved Responses",
          "config": {
            "condition": "{{1.approve}} = YES"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "searchRows",
          "label": "Find Row by Batch ID",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "searchCriteria": {
              "batch_id": "{{1.batch_id}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "updateRow",
          "label": "Update Approval Status",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "rowId": "{{3.id}}",
            "values": {
              "client_approval": "YES",
              "status": "APPROVED_FOR_PUBLISH",
              "editor_notes": "{{1.notes}}",
              "last_updated": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "from": 1,
          "to": 2
        },
        {
          "from": 2,
          "to": 3
        },
        {
          "from": 3,
          "to": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Scenario 3: Monthly Report Email",
      "description": "Generates and sends monthly client reports",
      "modules": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "type": "scheduler",
          "action": "schedule",
          "label": "Monthly Trigger",
          "config": {
            "schedule": "0 9 1 * *",
            "timezone": "America/New_York"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "googleSheets",
          "action": "searchRows",
          "label": "Get Published Posts",
          "config": {
            "spreadsheet": "Content_Batch",
            "searchCriteria": {
              "status": "PUBLISHED"
            },
            "dateRange": {
              "column": "last_updated",
              "start": "{{$subtractMonths($now, 1)}}",
              "end": "{{$now}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "aggregator",
          "label": "Group by Client",
          "config": {
            "groupBy": "client_name",
            "aggregate": [
              {
                "field": "wp_post_url",
                "operation": "list"
              },
              {
                "field": "topic",
                "operation": "list"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "type": "tools",
          "action": "textAggregator",
          "label": "Build Report Data",
          "config": {
            "template": "**Client:** {{3.client_name}}\n**Period:** Last 30 days\n\n**Published Posts:**\n{{#each 3.wp_post_url}}\n- {{this}} ({{../topic}})\n{{/each}}\n\n**Topics Covered:**\n{{#each 3.topic}}\n- {{this}}\n{{/each}}\n\n**Total Posts:** {{3.count}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "type": "http",
          "action": "makeRequest",
          "label": "Generate Email Summary with OpenAI",
          "config": {
            "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
            "method": "POST",
            "headers": {
              "Authorization": "Bearer {{$env.OPENAI_API_KEY}}",
              "Content-Type": "application/json"
            },
            "body": {
              "model": "gpt-4",
              "messages": [
                {
                  "role": "system",
                  "content": "You are a professional content marketing consultant writing client reports. Write friendly, professional emails that summarize content performance and suggest next steps."
                },
                {
                  "role": "user",
                  "content": "Generate a client-friendly email report based on this data:\n\n{{4.text}}\n\nInclude:\n1. Summary of what was published\n2. Topics covered\n3. Suggested next batch of topics\n4. Call to action\n\nKeep it professional but friendly."
                }
              ],
              "temperature": 0.7,
              "max_tokens": 1000
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "type": "gmail",
          "action": "sendEmail",
          "label": "Send Report Email",
          "config": {
            "to": "{{3.client_email}}",
            "subject": "Monthly Content Report - {{$formatDate($now, 'MMMM YYYY')}}",
            "body": "{{5.choices[0].message.content}}",
            "format": "html"
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "from": 1,
          "to": 2
        },
        {
          "from": 2,
          "to": 3
        },
        {
          "from": 3,
          "to": 4
        },
        {
          "from": 4,
          "to": 5
        },
        {
          "from": 5,
          "to": 6
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "environmentVariables": [
    {
      "name": "OPENAI_API_KEY",
      "description": "Your OpenAI API key for content generation",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "WORDPRESS_AUTH",
      "description": "WordPress REST API authentication (Base64 encoded username:password or application password)",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "name": "APPROVAL_FORM_ID",
      "description": "Google Form ID for client approvals (optional, for Scenario 2B)",
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "setupInstructions": {
    "googleSheet": {
      "name": "Content_Batch",
      "columns": [
        "batch_id",
        "client_name",
        "site_url",
        "topic",
        "primary_keyword",
        "intent",
        "target_word_count",
        "status",
        "draft_doc_url",
        "editor_notes",
        "client_approval",
        "wp_post_id",
        "wp_post_url",
        "publish_mode",
        "publish_datetime",
        "last_updated"
      ],
      "statusValues": [
        "READY_TO_DRAFT",
        "NEEDS_REVIEW",
        "CHANGES_REQUESTED",
        "APPROVED_FOR_PUBLISH",
        "PUBLISHED",
        "ERROR"
      ]
    },
    "googleDrive": {
      "folderStructure": "/Clients/{client_name}/Drafts/"
    },
    "wordPress": {
      "restApiEndpoint": "/wp-json/wp/v2/posts",
      "authentication": "Application Password or Basic Auth"
    }
  },
  "openAIPromptTemplate": {
    "description": "The exact prompt template used in Scenario 1 for generating WordPress-ready content",
    "template": "You are an expert SEO content writer. Write a comprehensive blog post with the following requirements:\n\n**Topic:** {topic}\n**Primary Keyword:** {primary_keyword}\n**Search Intent:** {intent}\n**Target Word Count:** {target_word_count}\n**Client Website:** {site_url}\n\n**Requirements:**\n1. Write in HTML format ready for WordPress\n2. Include proper H1, H2, H3 headings\n3. Add a meta description (150-160 characters)\n4. Suggest a URL slug\n5. Include internal linking opportunities\n6. Write engaging, informative content that matches the search intent\n7. Ensure content is factually accurate and well-researched\n8. Include a compelling introduction and conclusion\n\n**Output Format (JSON):**\n{\n  \"title\": \"SEO-optimized title\",\n  \"meta_description\": \"150-160 char description\",\n  \"slug\": \"url-friendly-slug\",\n  \"content\": \"Full HTML content here\",\n  \"excerpt\": \"Short excerpt for WordPress\"\n}\n\nBegin writing:"
  },
  "notes": [
    "This is a v0 'bare-bones' automation that gets you 80% of the value before building the full PRD system.",
    "Scenario 1 handles: Topic → Draft → Review notification",
    "Scenario 2 handles: Approval → WordPress Publish",
    "Scenario 2B is an alternative approval method via Google Forms",
    "Scenario 3 provides basic monthly reporting without deep analytics",
    "All scenarios include error handling and notifications",
    "The Google Sheet serves as the single source of truth",
    "You can import this JSON into Make.com and configure the connections"
  ]
}

